<h3 id="breadcrumbs">Breadcrumb NavXT</h3>
<p>
	The breadcrumbs in this theme are powered by the <strong>Breadcrumb NavXT</strong> plugin.
</p>
<p>
	All the settings for breadcrumbs can be found in <kbd><kbd><samp>Settings</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Breadcrumb NavXT</samp></kbd></kbd>. Here you can define a separator (which should be empty by default for our themes), breadcrumb hierarchies for different pages (pages, custom post types, taxonomy, ...) and set other breadcrumbs related things.
</p>
<h4>Default Product Breadcrumbs</h4>
<p>
	Let's take a look at how to setup the default breadcrumbs used on this theme for the <b>Products</b> custom post type. Go to <kbd><kbd><samp>Settings</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Breadcrumb NavXT</samp></kbd></kbd> and click on the <b>Post Types</b> tab. Scroll down to the <b>Product</b> section, and set the <b>Product Root Page</b> to <b>Shop</b> page and since we set the root page, we can also disable (uncheck) the <b>Product Archive Display</b> checkbox. Don't forget to save the settings.
</p>

